1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Mexican, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"2px6TBM430hX0T49rm95yQ","review_id":"MKt1bqKzVHPxpSGPeIi5Tw","date":"2020-03-22T18:27:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9475171566009521,"text_excerpt":"Felipe's is my go to spot for fresh Mexican food. My go to order is usually the chicken tacos on flour tortillas or a taco salad topped with pinto beans, sour cream, pico de Gallo, lettuce, cheese mild/hot salsa and you cannot forget their delicious queso. I sometimes stop by just to get chips and queso. The food is always hot and delicious and there isn't anything that I have had from them that I didn't enjoy. Not to mention everyday of the week they have a different drink special. Their margaritas are the best. Always enjoy eating here. I hope that they open a location in Jefferson Parish. :)"},{"business_id":"2px6TBM430hX0T49rm95yQ","review_id":"hI5_6vR8bHhr_QM_bsuoXA","date":"2020-09-19T21:22:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9390121698379517,"text_excerpt":"I went to the Felipe's on Carrolton, and had the steak and chicken burrito with queso on top. If you're a cheesy girl like me than you know queso makes everything taste amazing . The food was great and I've had their margaritas in the past, they are definitely worth the money. The service was quick and the restaurant was clean!"},{"business_id":"2px6TBM430hX0T49rm95yQ","review_id":"Zi4zInE1zVo8MYHF8-XM6g","date":"2014-01-16T15:13:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9370229244232178,"text_excerpt":"Have you been to the Felipe's in the French Quarter? In Uptown, by Tulane? If you answered yes, then you know what to expect. Good food, great atmosphere, good drinks. Did you say no? To clarify, you've never been to a Felipe's? Go grab a couple of friends and go asap! Walk up to the food bar, and place your order, watch them assemble it for you, then go to the drink bar, and place order for you drinks. Then proceed to consume food and drinks with great merriment! I also really like this place because its inexpensive and you pay for your own meal upfront. You don't have to worry about splitting the bill at the end. Best part? It looks like it should be a loud restaurant where you have to ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"2px6TBM430hX0T49rm95yQ","photo_id":"ps0wCotPoD-_Ix95dHg3iw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/ps0wCotPoD-_Ix95dHg3iw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9045788049697876},{"business_id":"2px6TBM430hX0T49rm95yQ","photo_id":"IEtuCnxLu3lOrslfYqfwyA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/IEtuCnxLu3lOrslfYqfwyA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9044196605682373},{"business_id":"2px6TBM430hX0T49rm95yQ","photo_id":"EZIA_hs6tXrYeXdryhFtqg","label"